The legal texts in this repository are the Constitution, codes, laws, decrees and normative resolutions of the
Republic of Kazakhstan as published by the Adilet legal information system (adilet.zan.kz) of the Institute of
Legislation and Legal Information, Ministry of Justice of the Republic of Kazakhstan.

Official documents (laws, court decisions and other texts of a legislative, administrative or judicial character)
are not objects of copyright under the Law of the Republic of Kazakhstan on Copyright and Related Rights, article
8(1). Adilet's Terms of Use (https://adilet.zan.kz/legal/polzovatelskoe-soglashenie.docx, point 4.3.2) allow its
materials to be used for personal, informational, research and professional purposes and require Adilet to be named
as the source when they are quoted or distributed: source, НЦПС «Әділет» / ИПС «Әділет», https://adilet.zan.kz.

The first build's text (removed) was read from Internet Archive captures of Adilet pages.

Lexifina's own work in this repository (the arrangement, tables, commit messages, STRUCTURE.md, corpus.json and
tools) is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).

This repository is not legal advice and not an official publication.
